          "notes_base": "Moxy Xi'an South (碑林太乙路) — Marriott brand boutique design hotel, ~275-354 CNY/night. 大众点评必住榜 hotel. Located in Beilin District (碑林区) inside the ancient city area, ~10 min walk to Bell Tower (钟楼), City Wall south gate, Muslim Quarter (回民街). Standout breakfast with Shaanxi specialties. Young, energetic design with 24hr gym and self-service laundry. Book via Marriott Bonvoy or Ctrip. Matilde solo arrival May 10.",
          "notes_local": "西安莫克西酒店（碑林太乙路店）——万豪旗下精品设计酒店，约275-354元/晚。大众点评必住酒店。位于碑林区古城核心区，步行约10分钟可达钟楼、城墙南门和回民街。早餐品质极高，含陕西特色。酒店风格年轻有活力，配有24小时健身房和自助洗衣房。可通过万豪或携程预订。Matilde于5月10日单独入住。",
          "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/b12d2fd528697e5b56399db974626b98"
        }
